# UI overlay painting's suspension through loads: F4 open over the title and the
# career's load into the city, then over the load of a race (boot-to-race.pad).
wait 8s
key F4
mark title_f4
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
key F4
mark roam_f4_closed
mark menu
wait 1s 60f
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
# Pause -> Modes; Arcade; Ordered race; Sunset and Vine (the first of each).
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
press a 4f
wait 2500ms 150f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
# The race options start at the arcade defaults (the save copy's). A held
# direction repeats after about 8 game updates, so presses last 4 updates
# (one step each, capped or not) and the gaps are real time (the menus move
# 30 times a second of real time).
# Number of opponents 3 -> 7.
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Difficulty Medium -> Easy, so the opponents stay in sight for longer.
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press left 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Down to Weather (past Power ups: Off, Traffic: Normal).
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Weather Dynamic -> Clear, Partly cloudy, Cloudy, Rainy.
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 300ms 18f
# Time of day Dynamic -> Midnight.
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press right 4f
wait 800ms 48f
# Start race. The game state is 3 (loading) from the arcade map until the race
# is ready, so "roam" holds again when the intro starts.
key F4
mark load_f4
wait 500ms
press a 4f
wait_until roam 120s
mark race_intro
wait 4s
key F4
mark race_f4_closed
wait 3s
mark end
wait 1s
